# =============================================================================
# Lawyer's E-Diary (LED) — Cloud Functions configuration reference only.
#
# Do not put credentials in this file or copy it to a deployable .env file.
# Configure both values as Firebase server-side secrets after code review.
#
# Configure with the Firebase CLI (never paste the values into source):
#   firebase functions:secrets:set ECOURTS_API_KEY
#   firebase functions:secrets:set ECOURTS_BASE_URL
#
# API contract documented in the repository reference implementation:
# GET {ECOURTS_BASE_URL}/v1/cases/cnr/{CNR}
# Header: x-api-key (ECOURTS_API_KEY)
# Base URL example: https://webapi.ecourtsindia.com